	(text "ideas:\nbuck-boost from <3v to 5v to make it work of lipo or usb or gods will\nas small as the wroom module\nmostly pins, not many connectors\ncompatible with many sensors (top priority is ov5640)\nno edge connectors and 2 layer pcb so it's easy and cheap to manufarture\nfully solderable by hand (preferably a hand with a soldering iron)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
